title: Four Winds
text: The STARBURST is fixed to the board. A beam that enters it leaves as four beams, each turned 45 degrees from it: come in on a slant and they go out straight to all four sides.
trick: starburst basics: a diagonal beam into a starburst comes out as a plus sign
motif: compass: four straight arms around the starburst
expect: shared>=1
